msgid "Redstone Lamp"
msgstr "Redstone lanpara"

msgid "Glows when powered by redstone power"
msgstr "Dir-dir egiten du redstone bidez aktibatzen denean"

msgid "Redstone lamps are simple redstone components which glow brightly (light level @1) when they receive redstone power."
msgstr ""
"Redstone lanparak redstone energia jasotzen dutenean distira handia (@1 argi "
"maila) egiten duten redstone osagai sinpleak dira."
